          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e12-hobbies-at-home/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now, in this part of the test, you're going to talk about something together for about two or three minutes.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e12-hobbies-at-home/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 150,
          "diagram": "b1-e12-hobbies-at-home",
          "text": "A friend of yours has a lot of free time and wants to start a new hobby. Here are some hobbies he could try. Talk together about the different hobbies, and say which would be the best.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e12-hobbies-at-home/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about hobbies.",
